{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Take nearby object, move to location, check properties, perform specific task, or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Condition ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
